## What it does

Ask a question in plain language and get an answer drawn from the company's own
analytics, not a generic guess from the model.

## Approach

A retrieval pipeline embeds the source data, pulls the passages most relevant to
each question, and grounds the model's answer in those passages. Every answer can
be traced back to real records instead of invented ones.

## Stack

Python and FastAPI on the backend, OpenAI embeddings for retrieval, and LangChain
to orchestrate the pipeline.
